[00:21.34]With dignity and joy,
[00:27.58]A threefold cord is bound.
[00:34.48]With God and men to witness,
[00:41.36]These sacred vows resound.
[00:47.64](Chorus 1)
[00:47.79]He vowed before Jehovah
[00:53.68]To love her from the heart.
[01:01.94]“What God has yoked together,
[01:07.86]Let no man put apart.”
[01:37.82]They both have searched God’s Word
[01:39.68]To learn to do his will,
[01:40.87]And now they seek his blessing,
[01:42.53]Their promise to fulfill.
[01:43.78](Chorus 2)
[01:43.93]She vowed before Jehovah
[01:45.32]To love him from the heart.
[01:53.36]“What God has yoked together,
[02:00.14]Let no man put apart.”
